,"title":"4.0.36.Final","description":"","creator":{"login":"normanmaurer","id":439362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":24,"state":"closed","created_at":"2016-03-21T10:40:25Z","updated_at":"2016-05-20T07:09:30Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2016-04-04T16:36:46Z"},"comments":12,"created_at":"2015-12-29T17:46:37Z","updated_at":"2016-03-27T18:21:51Z","closed_at":"2016-03-27T18:21:51Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I have a certificate/key in a .p12 file. I exported the key to a .pem file as follows:\n\n``` sh\nopenssl pkcs12 -in aps-key.p12 -nocerts -out aps-key.pem\n```\n\n…and wound up with a file that looks like this:\n\n```\nBag Attributes\n    friendlyName: HTTP/2 test\n    localKeyID: F6 24 E2 FE 0A 69 C5 BA D5 FD 0C 57 01 9F 0C 1D FF 8F 4B 62 \nKey Attributes: <No Attributes>\n-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----\nProc-Type: 4,ENCRYPTED\nDEK-Info: DES-EDE3-CBC,FA13E529699D3D45\n\n<base64-encoded key here>\n-----END RSA PRIVATE KEY-----\n```\n\nI'm trying to load the key using `SslContextBuilder#keyManager(File, File, String)`, but `PemReader` is failing to find the key in the file because `KEY_PATTERN` doesn't match. It appears to be stumbling on the headers (`Proc-Type` and `DEK-Info`, which contain unexpected characters) inside the private key block. Those headers are generated by at least OpenSSL 0.9.8zg, but don't seem to be generated by OpenSSL 1.0.2e at the latest. I haven't checked versions in between.\n\nFor the sake of completeness, the stack trace looks like:\n\n```\n… java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: File does not contain valid private key: /Users/jon/Desktop/aps-key.pem\n    at io.netty.handler.ssl.SslContextBuilder.keyManager(SslContextBuilder.java:201)\n    at SslHandshakeClient.main(SslHandshakeClient.java:34)\nCaused by: java.security.KeyException: found no private key: /Users/jon/Desktop/aps-key.pem\n    at io.netty.handler.ssl.PemReader.readPrivateKey(PemReader.java:99)\n    at io.netty.handler.ssl.SslContext.toPrivateKey(SslContext.java:923)\n    at io.netty.handler.ssl.SslContextBuilder.keyManager(SslContextBuilder.java:199)\n    ... 1 more\n```\n\nEDIT: This is happening with Netty 4.1 beta 8.\n","closed_by":{"login":"normanmaurer","id":439362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/4637/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/4637/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}